ssociation\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>HQ</span> <span>05/19/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z890-I GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Best Intel Mini-ITX Motherboard\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.eha.digital/2025/05/19/eha-awards-2025-winners-announced/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/logo/default.jpg\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Gamers Choice\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Overclock3d.net\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Gamers Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS ROG Strix Z890-I Gaming WiFi is nearly everything you could want from a small form factor and wins our OC3D Gamers Choice Award.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>UNITED KINGDOM</span> <span>06/24/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z890-I GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Gamers Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://overclock3d.net/reviews/cpu_mainboard/asus-rog-strix-z890-i-gaming-wifi-review/13/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202503271705353640543.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Techtest 90%\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Techtest.org\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Techtest 90%</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ASUS delivers its usual strong performance with the ROG Strix Z890-I Gaming WIFI.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>03/27/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z890-I GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Techtest 90%\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://techtest.org/asus-rog-strix-z890-i-gaming-wifi-test-itx-mainboard-mit-hive-ii-und-thunderbolt-4/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/15003.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Silver Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Cowcotland\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Silver Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      It boasts many features, brings modern connectivity, a robust power supply section and, for such a compact design, the build quality remains excellent.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>07/13/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z890-I GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Silver Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.cowcotland.com/articles/4998/carte-mere-asus-rog-strix-z890-i-gaming-wifi-utile-ou-pas.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202502051626358410408.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Ultimate\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Tweakers.net\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Ultimate</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS ROG Strix X870-I Gaming Wifi, which we previously awarded with an Ultimate award, has the main advantage of having two M.2 slots on the front of the motherboard\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"Produ